          "title": "You'll want to know: die Äußerung",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Äußerung — \"the remark, the statement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Seine Äußerung über die Kollegen war nicht nett. His remark about his colleagues was not nice."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Äußerungen. The noun of äußern — to express."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Äußerung is the noun of äußern \"to express\", built on außer, from Middle High German ūzer and Old High German ūzar \"out of\" (EtymDB): you put a thought outside."
            }
          ]
        },
