          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "hinweisen — \"to indicate, to call attention to\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Der Arzt hat darauf hingewiesen, dass ich mehr Wasser trinken soll. The doctor noted that I should drink more water."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Separable and strong: er weist darauf hin, er hat darauf hingewiesen. Auf etwas hinweisen — to call attention to something."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "hinweisen is built from hin \"towards there\" and weisen \"to show, to direct\" (EtymDB): you show someone where to look."
